                <head>222. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On June 18, 1962, Director of the Bureau of Intelligence and Research Hilsman
                    transmitted RFE-27 to Assistant Secretary of State for Far Eastern Affairs
                    Harriman. This was a progress report summarizing the major goals and
                    accomplishments of the counter-insurgency program in South Vietnam. For text of
                    this memorandum, see <hi rendition="#italic">United States-Vietnam Relations,
                        1945-1967</hi>, Book 12, pages 469-480.</p>
            </div>
